  triage:title "Escalation cadence factor and doctor TASK_STALLED threshold are two unsynced magic literals (10) in two crates" ;
  triage:description "AX.6 QA-1 (quality-mgr QA-AX6-R1-1788626395, PR #1204 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T16:56Z) at head 490a6c42a0f3283c251875d9a61fcf99b641c2a2. crates/atm-core/src/doctor/mod.rs:661 and crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake_escalation.rs:25 each inline the literal 10 for the same architectural question (reminder count at which a task is stalled / escalated), with nothing keeping them in sync. Repeatable. Fix: introduce one shared constant in atm-core's boundary surface and use it in both crates." ;
